[{"title":"西山孝子吟","author":"何基","text":"君不见东京茅季伟，布褐躬耕具甘旨。\n烹鸡馈母供晨羞，却办草蔬为客礼。\n北州高士郭林宗，一见惊嗟不能已。\n又不见唐朝董邵南，穷居行义无与比。\n朝耕夜读养双亲，孝格天翁降祥祉。\n一时好事昌黎公，为作启诗歌盛美。\n两君制行固已奇，姓名自足垂千祀。\n更有高贤为发挥，至今赫然在人耳。\n几年见说西山汪，信义当时表闾里。\n只今家虽四壁空，却有贤孙祖风似。\n力田养亲孝行高，千载董茅同一轨。\n孑然只影无妻儿，手自耔耘供滫瀡。\n乃翁丧明三十年，膝下承颜不离跬。\n三时但务亲耕锄，一日何曾入城市。\n朝朝敬问衣燠寒，旦旦谨察食丰菲。\n一畦早韭登春盘，五母黄鸡荐秋黍。\n尽心自足为亲欢，岂必三牲八珍侈。\n谨身百不贻亲忧，父子熙熙和气里。\n翁目虽瞽翁心怡，八十庞眉反儿齿。\n迩来瓶粟颇不悭，积善固宜天相只。\n乡闾咏叹同一声，养志如君能有几。\n人有诗书君未学，我谓如君真学矣。\n孝弟是乃百行先，为仁每必从此始。\n世人有亲不能养，浪著儒冠诚可耻。\n何如汪君贫窭中，卓然合此秉彝理。\n拱辰山人孝义家，冰鉴可与郭韩拟。\n闻君之风喜欲颠，挥洒龙蛇忽盈纸。\n诸君自感声气同，杂以清商间流徵。\n既经名胜文发扬，一日传誇满桑梓。\n我虽病倦愧不文，亦作长谣绍貂尾。\n安得是邦贤使君，特为蜚笺启丹扆。\n峨峨双表旌高门，题作西山汪孝子。\n名配此山长不穷，来者人人为兴起。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29872,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"老菊次时所性韵","author":"何基","text":"独步东篱餐落菊，一幅乌纱漉浮玉。\n悠然谢客欲醉眠，懒拾枯枝炮脱粟。\n靖节先生骨已寒，回生何必须神丹。\n紫阳一字冠青史，名节恃此安如山。\n义熙一去知几变，金钿翠葆犹年年。\n我生因循颠已华，甚矣今年脱左车。\n嘲红弄绿少时态，岁晚相对惟寒花。\n雨荒深院黄金尽，谁谓颜色埋尘沙。\n高风雅致随遇见，帘外玉立横枝斜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29873,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题定武兰亭副本","author":"何基","text":"文皇命殉昭陵土，兰亭神迹埋千古。\n率更拓本勒坚珉，盐帝归装留定武。\n薛家翻刻愚贵游，旧本和龛归御府。\n烟尘横空飞渡河，中原荆棘交豹虎。\n维扬苍莅驾南辕，百年文物不堪补。\n纷纷好事竞新摹，倾敧丑俗亡遗矩。\n如今薛本亦罕见，髹■典型犹媚妩。\n清欢盛会何足传，右军他帖以千数。\n托言此笔不可再，慨然陈迹兴怀语。\n今昔相视无已时，手掩尘编对秋雨。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29874,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"访杨船山道中迷涂和王元思韵","author":"何基","text":"审问方知道，冥行易失岐。\n每因贪径捷，多致落嵚巇。\n浪谓途言惑，先由己意移。\n知津要端的，直造始无疑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29875,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日閒居","author":"何基","text":"轻阴薄薄笼朝曦，小雨斑斑湿燕泥。\n春草阶前随意绿，晓莺花里尽情啼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29876,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春晚郊行","author":"何基","text":"村烟澹澹日沈西，岸柳阴阴水拍堤。\n江上晚风吹树急，落红满地鹧鸪啼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29877,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"法清寺水珠呈杜季高","author":"何基","text":"垒石为山已浪呼，小球戏水更名珠。\n世间何事非虚假，还值先生一笑无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29878,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夹竹梅","author":"何基","text":"不染世间儿女尘，任他桃李自争春。\n也应高洁难为对，独有修篁是可人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29879,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宽儿辈","author":"何基","text":"丈夫何事怕饥穷，况复箪瓢亦未空。\n万卷诗书真活计，一山梅竹自清风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29880,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂诗 其一","author":"何基","text":"一敬由来入道门，须臾不在便非仁。\n直须认取惺惺法，莫作回头错应人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29881,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂诗 其二","author":"何基","text":"善恶分明虽两歧，念端差处只毫釐。\n怕将私意为天理，所以先民贵致知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29882,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂诗 其三","author":"何基","text":"圣门事业远难攀，立志须同古孔颜。\n井不及泉犹弃井，山如亏篑未为山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29883,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送王敬岩江东都宪 其一","author":"何基","text":"褰帷不惮暑天长，少试平生活国方。\n吏蠹民冤尽梳洗，要令枯旱变丰穰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29884,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送王敬岩江东都宪 其二","author":"何基","text":"狱情微暧自难明，著意平反或失平。\n生死两无纤芥恨，考求须尽察须精。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29885,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送王敬岩江东都宪 其三","author":"何基","text":"功夫真处在持操，外泽中乾亦谩劳。\n独探圣言求实用，岂同末俗为名高。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29886,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"缴回太守赵庸斋照牒","author":"何基","text":"闭关方喜得幽栖，何用邦侯更品题。\n自分终身守环堵，不将一步出盘溪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29887,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题徐伯光真","author":"何基","text":"舞雩春服浴沂侣，社饮衣蓑学稼翁。\n可士可农随地乐，此心无处不春风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29888,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送淮西左宪知黄州","author":"何基","text":"日向庭闱綵服趋，天边忽下紫泥书。\n分铜既佩诸侯印，衣绣仍登使者车。\n万灶貔貅须宿饱，九州鸿雁要安居。\n笑谈了却公家事，指日催归侍玉除。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29889,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寒夜寄友","author":"何基","text":"月色窥人冷，梅花何处香。\n遥思栖隐客，高啸白云乡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29890,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"何基","text":"皓首何妨一布衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29891,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜泊长河","author":"许棐","text":"黄帽贪程夜泊迟，市楼灯火歇多时。\n满怀风月无分付，却借渔翁短笛吹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29892,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"访潘叔明","author":"许棐","text":"一室宽于养鹤笼，荻帘疏透雪花风。\n怪来几案无寒色，春在题诗卷子中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29893,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"明妃","author":"许棐","text":"汉宫眉斧息边尘，功压貔貅百万人。\n好把香闺旧脂粉，艳妆颜色上麒麟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29894,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"醉起","author":"许棐","text":"午醉醺醺到日晡，起呼茶盌炷熏炉。\n隔窗几点敲花雨，子细听时却又无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29895,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"帕子","author":"许棐","text":"万缕纵横如妾恨，一方轻薄似郎恩。\n多时不系纤腰舞，却对花前拭泪痕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29896,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚泊临平","author":"许棐","text":"晚卸风帆泊市桥，税亭民屋总萧条。\n秦封不到河边柳，送往迎来枉折腰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29897,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元夕后湖上作","author":"许棐","text":"自从楼阁罢烧灯，未有今朝一日晴。\n暖拆葑边冰翼破，寒留山顶雪痕轻。\n娇骢已印寻芳迹，小妓新翻鬻唱声。\n每个旗亭商一醉，也应排日到清明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29898,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"沈子寿郊居","author":"许棐","text":"屋外犹馀地百弓，经锄知费几年工。\n栽蔬少似于陵仲，种菊多于靖节翁。\n偃屈溪山诗卷里，破除风月酒杯中。\n近来又喜禅机透，一顾丛林万衲空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29899,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠叶靖逸","author":"许棐","text":"借得城居一丈宽，五车书向腹中安。\n声华馥似当风桂，气味清于著露兰。\n朝士时将馀俸赠，铺家传得近诗刊。\n回看旧隐西湖上，谁伴沙鸥度岁寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29900,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠龚彦质","author":"许棐","text":"慈湖分与半窗灯，照得襟怀彻底明。\n蒲座夜闲猫占卧，笋舆春暖鹤随行。\n炉香欲尽经犹诵，砚墨才浓句已成。\n岁晚弟兄俱白首，一楼风雨话深更。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29901,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题常穆仲蘸碧","author":"许棐","text":"舫样一亭小，依山复靠池。\n每来分席坐，须忆下湖时。\n竹弄当窗影，花添蘸水枝。\n人间风浪恶，泛宅几天涯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29902,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赵叔鲁","author":"许棐","text":"天上除书骆驿飞，谪仙何事得来迟。\n旅怀宽似居家日，学力高于未第时。\n山带晴霏横画轴，水流清响入琴丝。\n世间多少王孙贵，无我寒泉一句诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29903,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋江渔父","author":"许棐","text":"小舟轻似一鸥飞，恋月随风惯不归。\n困卧芦花深雪里，夜寒添盖旧蓑衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29904,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山间","author":"许棐","text":"趁得山间笋蕨春，借厨烹煮自吹薪。\n倩谁分我杯羹去，寄与中朝食肉人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29905,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"木山父书院","author":"许棐","text":"占得文房一丈强，地幽虽夏亦清凉。\n瓶花误倒水侵案，书叶乱掀风满床。\n薜长密藤遮半壁，桐分疏影出低墙。\n客来莫道无祗待，只啜茶瓯却味长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29906,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蜡梅江梅同瓶","author":"许棐","text":"苗裔元从庾岭分，两般标致一般春。\n淡妆西子呈娇态，黄面瞿昙现小身。\n不羡腰金横玉贵，来寻嚼蜡饮冰人。\n只愁花谢香狼籍，桃李如何接后陈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29907,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠画鱼沈秀才","author":"许棐","text":"写字摛文不疗饥，生涯换得颇新奇。\n锦心暗织临渊网，蓬鬓潜缫钓雨丝。\n落笔易于投饵处，得钱多似出罾时。\n渔翁枉占烟波阔，不及君家小砚池。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29908,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠北涧","author":"许棐","text":"天下名山行脚遍，依然形影瘦伶俜。\n支吾寒暑袈裟耐，变眩烟霞笔砚灵。\n对客敬如堂上佛，读书通似藏中经。\n石头路滑终难到，不是诗禅莫扣扃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29909,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪晓","author":"许棐","text":"腊雪连宵接晓飞，锦衾公子未曾知。\n起来携杖敲梅树，扶得轻盈压损枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29910,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闺怨五首 其一","author":"许棐","text":"眉锁从春不暂开，懒移心事向妆台。\n恩情恰似残花片，去逐东流更不回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29911,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闺怨五首 其二","author":"许棐","text":"别后相思瘦玉肌，不堪重著看花衣。\n恨君得似梁间燕，社日辞家社日归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29912,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闺怨五首 其三","author":"许棐","text":"月引庭花影上窗，闷和簪朵卧空床。\n春寒翠被无人共，闲却熏炉一字香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29913,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闺怨五首 其四","author":"许棐","text":"离愁一点浓如黛，强把金篦扫不开。\n新月几番呈巧样，薄情夫婿未归来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29914,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闺怨五首 其五","author":"许棐","text":"小院东风去住中，春愁元不隔帘栊。\n自家颜色凋零尽，却对花枝惜堕红。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29915,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"枯荷","author":"许棐","text":"万柄绿荷衰飒尽，雨中无可盖眠鸥。\n当时乍叠青钱满，肯信池塘有暮秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29916,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庭树","author":"许棐","text":"今年庭树著花稀，因是耽书失事治。\n何处结巢双喜鹊，却来删得几枯枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29917,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春晚","author":"许棐","text":"推过诗编把酒斟，挽春佳句让莺吟。\n门前却喜无人扫，积得残花一寸深。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29918,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠临上人","author":"许棐","text":"绕湖山叠翠，师住最高层。\n野偈书林叶，茶铛煮涧冰。\n松筠为道友，日月是禅灯。\n傥许分峰隐，甘为有发僧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29919,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"客路","author":"许棐","text":"客路久驱驰，秋深两鬓知。\n田家投夜宿，渔灶寄晨炊。\n契分灯前影，生涯橐里诗。\n遥怜故园菊，荒草没霜枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29920,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"钟俊卿见访","author":"许棐","text":"荒圃知非延客地，谩分苔石坐移时。\n杯中浅注三行酒，几上同看数板诗。\n树未经霜飞叶早，菊因闰月放花迟。\n自无景物留君住，却恨西山日半规。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29921,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题倦庵","author":"许棐","text":"自扁庵为倦，斯名恐未然。\n醉巾频漉破，游屐几磨穿。\n新种竹都活，旧栽花更妍。\n门前春水涨，催发孝廉船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29922,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠元耘轩","author":"许棐","text":"白发萧萧客帝都，故园闲却种瓜锄。\n平时不信为儒误，今日方知涉世疏。\n烟浦未寻归去艇，雪窗犹读借来书。\n诗名压尽江湖客，要在唐人向上居。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29923,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题吴叔清郊居","author":"许棐","text":"哦松未了赋归欤，旋买田园结草庐。\n数亩竹阴惟欠鹤，半池山影不妨鱼。\n举杯多是沽来酒，插架无非读过书。\n我已倦为都下客，愿君分与把茅居。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29924,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雁字","author":"许棐","text":"点画分明印碧空，回鸾返鹊势差同。\n月边映得银钩体，雪里摹成玉箸工。\n断续似经秦火后，悲凉如在楚词中。\n愁人笔砚俱荒废，倩写相思寄便风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29925,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词二首 其一","author":"许棐","text":"卧听羊车辊夜雷，知从谁处燕酣回。\n蟾光也解君王意，隔个帘栊不入来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29926,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宫词二首 其二","author":"许棐","text":"同入宫来几许人，因何遣妾护长门。\n云鬟半脱香腮瘦，却爱菱花镜子昏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29927,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"忆郑元甫","author":"许棐","text":"别后黄花两度残，天涯彼此寄书难。\n几行雁字斜阳里，聊当平安一纸看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29928,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠芸窗","author":"许棐","text":"能书能画又能诗，除却芸窗别数谁。\n只是霜毫冰茧纸，才经拈起便新奇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29929,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戍妇词一首","author":"许棐","text":"半落釭花午夜闲，戍衣裁就寄君难。\n雁来不带平安字，却带边风入帐寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29930,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠陈宗之","author":"许棐","text":"六月长安热似焚，廛中清趣总输君。\n买书人散桐阴晚，卧看风行水上文。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29931,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"伤春曲","author":"许棐","text":"日日望郎郎未归，玉肌宽尽缕金衣。\n春心撩乱强拘束，碎剪红绡补旧枝。\n红绡才向枝头住，残花又逐东风去。\n愿花飞入笑筵中，莫入愁人断肠处。\n愁人见花人自羞，花见愁人花也愁。\n花飞有尽愁无尽，柳外一声黄栗留。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29932,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"四时宫词各一首 其一","author":"许棐","text":"因见落花心觉悟，薄罗襟上泪痕乾。\n容颜纵似花枝好，能得君王几日看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29933,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"四时宫词各一首 其二","author":"许棐","text":"碧玉凉梳落枕边，懒梳双鬓学新蝉。\n恩情不及班姬扇，纵是炎天亦弃捐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29934,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"四时宫词各一首 其三","author":"许棐","text":"凉夜谁同玉簟眠，湘波冷浸一枝莲。\n君王不学中秋月，处处分身处处圆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29935,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"四时宫词各一首 其四","author":"许棐","text":"雪压长门消未尽，夜衾堆尽旧宫罗。\n鸳鸯瓦下垂冰箸，未抵思君玉箸多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29936,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"郭评事","author":"许棐","text":"廷评满腹贮阳春，笔下从来活几人。\n厅小似分幽寺住，俸轻如在旧山贫。\n堆书教子犹疑少，倒屣迎宾不厌频。\n欲效林宗巾角垫，自嫌双鬓有红尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29937,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽吴春伯","author":"许棐","text":"入门诸子哭褰衣，痛说严君属纩时。\n病重刀圭难作效，家贫衾含不如仪。\n从春屡有登临约，近日方无唱和诗。\n执绋南屏山下路，悲风吹乱绿杨丝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29938,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挽郭子度","author":"许棐","text":"连年染患貌栀黄，卢扁犹无起死方。\n稚女自敲尸畔磬，邻僧来炷佛前香。\n生涯谩有千书卷，受用惟存一奠觞。\n听说茶毗心更苦，拭乾清泪又成行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29939,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄吴宜之","author":"许棐","text":"文公徒弟无多在，学术应如寿数高。\n好句先教诸子和，垫巾翻被俗人嘲。\n湖边茶店同谁坐，井畔柴扉欠我敲。\n昨夜相思眠不稳，月眉斜印落花梢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_4.csv","pointer":29940,"sha256":"1b045fa2dd3ab3468e9fdf6659b7a150090f60cf8115e7a4663c55b017b46066","dynasty":"宋"}}]